{
  "doc": "tools/check_data_family.py 的文件清单（lane seq4）。同族 = scenes.json 那一族：主表是带唯一字符串 id 的条目表（F1），条目里有字段指向同表的 id、成一张图（F2），游戏运行时读它（F3，scripts/ 或 scenes/ 里写了文件名），且图有入口，「从入口走不到 = 孤儿」有定义（F4，人判，写在 roots 里）。F1–F3 由脚本自动普查：data/ 下满足 F1–F3 的文件必须登在 families（同族，跑四项结构检查）或 not_family（写明 F4 为何不成立）之一，漏登即红。新增同族文件怎么接入：见 check_data_family.py 文档串「接入」一段。",
  "families": [
    {
      "file": "data/scenes.json",
      "table": "scenes",
      "id": "id",
      "top": {
        "start_scene": "str",
        "scenes": "list"
      },
      "kinds": [
        {
          "name": "deprecated",
          "when": {
            "field": "deprecated",
            "eq": true
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "chapter": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "location": "str",
            "body": "str",
            "choices": "list<@choice>",
            "deprecated": "bool",
            "objective?": "str"
          },
          "orphan_ok": "显式标了 deprecated: true 的留档幕，本就不进主线"
        },
        {
          "name": "title",
          "when": {
            "field": "type",
            "eq": "title"
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "type": "str",
            "chapter": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "location": "str",
            "cg": "str",
            "cg_title": "str",
            "cg_sub": "str",
            "body": "str",
            "choices": "list<@choice>"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "port",
          "when": {
            "field": "type",
            "eq": "port"
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "type": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "location": "str",
            "facilities": "list<@facility>"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "investigation",
          "when": {
            "field": "type",
            "eq": "investigation"
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "type": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "body": "str",
            "investigations": "list<@investigation>",
            "choices": "list<@choice>"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "result",
          "when": {
            "has": "result"
          },
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "result": "str|list<str>",
            "options?": "list<@option>"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "story",
          "when": {},
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "chapter": "str",
            "title": "str",
            "location": "str",
            "body": "str",
            "choices": "list<@choice>",
            "cg?": "str",
            "objective?": "str",
            "speaker?": "str",
            "require_any?": "list<str>",
            "require_chapter?": "int"
          }
        }
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "choice": {
          "label": "str",
          "next": "str",
          "effects?": "dict"
        },
        "investigation": {
          "id": "str",
          "label": "str",
          "text": "str",
          "effects": "dict",
          "next": "str"
        },
        "facility": {
          "id": "str",
          "title": "str",
          "subtitle": "str",
          "body": "str"
        },
        "option": {
          "label": "str"
        }
      },
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "choices[].next",
          "edge": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            },
            {
              "file": "data/ports.json",
              "path": "ports[].id"
            }
          ],
          "why": "Main.load_scene 先查 scenes.json、再查 ports.json（通用港口页）"
        },
        {
          "path": "investigations[].next",
          "edge": true,
          "allow_empty": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            }
          ],
          "why": "Main._on_investigate_pressed：next 空串 = 留在本页、按钮置灰"
        },
        {
          "path": "investigations[].id",
          "edge": false,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            }
          ],
          "why": "调查项 id → 同名详情场（带 result 的幕）须存在；Main._on_investigate_pressed 只读 text / effects / next，不按 id 跳，所以不成边（与 lane seq3 口径同）"
        },
        {
          "path": "facilities[].id",
          "edge": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            },
            {
              "gd_const": "scripts/Main.gd",
              "name": "REMAPPED_FACILITIES"
            }
          ],
          "why": "港卡设施门 id 须是 Main.REMAPPED_FACILITIES 之一；只有 PROLOGUE_ONLY_FACILITIES 里的港卡直进同名 scenes.json 幕（成边），其余被改写成 {港}_{后缀} 动态页、进不到 scenes.json（与 lane seq3 口径同）",
          "edge_if": {
            "gd_const": "scripts/Main.gd",
            "name": "PROLOGUE_ONLY_FACILITIES"
          }
        }
      ],
      "not_edges": [],
      "roots": [
        {
          "path": "start_scene",
          "must": true,
          "why": "开局幕"
        },
        {
          "file": "data/ports.json",
          "path": "ports[].id",
          "why": "海图抵港 load_scene(港 id)，同名 type=port 幕由此进"
        },
        {
          "file": "data/chapters.json",
          "path": "chapters[].advance_scene",
          "why": "升章过场后进的幕"
        },
        {
          "file": "data/chapters.json",
          "path": "chapters[].endings[].scene",
          "why": "第四章结局幕"
        },
        {
          "gd_calls": "load_scene",
          "why": "scripts/ 里 load_scene(\"字面量\") 直跳"
        }
      ],
      "known_orphans": [
        {
          "from": {
            "py_const": "tools/verify_story_data.py",
            "name": "SCENE_ARCHIVE"
          },
          "why": "基线与 lane seq3 的 scenes.json 结构门禁共用一份：verify_story_data.SCENE_ARCHIVE（39 个：序章旧链 4、city_tavern / city_shipyard 两个港卡被 REMAPPED 改写进不到的调查页、result 形详情场 33），只减不增由那边的 SCENE_ARCHIVE_MAX 管；这里另判名单里的已可达 / 已删 / 已 deprecated"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "data/ports.json",
      "table": "ports",
      "id": "id",
      "top": {
        "meta": "dict",
        "ports": "list"
      },
      "kinds": [
        {
          "name": "port",
          "when": {},
          "fields": {
            "id": "str",
            "name": "str",
            "region": "str",
            "status": "str",
            "lat": "num",
            "lon": "num",
            "chart": "dict",
            "depth": "int",
            "unlock": "str",
            "tags": "list<str>",
            "connections": "list<str>",
            "market": "dict",
            "war?": "dict"
          }
        }
      ],
      "shapes": {},
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "connections[]",
          "edge": true,
          "to": [
            {
              "self": true
            }
          ],
          "why": "熟路连线；Voyage.is_known_route 按无向认，不相连只能走生路"
        },
        {
          "path": "market{}",
          "to": [
            {
              "file": "data/goods.json",
              "path": "goods[].id"
            }
          ],
          "why": "牙行货表的键是货物 id"
        }
      ],
      "undirected": true,
      "not_edges": [],
      "roots": [
        {
          "gd_regex": "scripts/GameState.gd",
          "pattern": "^var last_port: String = \"([a-z_]+)\"",
          "must": true,
          "why": "GameState.last_port 缺省值 = 开局港"
        }
      ],
      "known_orphans": []
    }
  ],
  "not_family": [
    {
      "file": "data/characters.json",
      "why": "F1–F3 成立（relations[].id / sources.npc_id / sources.crew_id 指回同表），F4 不成立：relations 是人物志的注记边、不是跳转，图没有入口；实测 25 人无入边属正常（只在别人传里出现的史实人物），孤儿判据无定义。字段 / 文案层另由 verify_story_data（CHAR_STRUCT 等）守"
    }
  ]
}
